(For a P2 incident within the explicitly named maintenance operation, a qualifying detection) Tj T*
(occurring inside its authorized half-open window receives an effective acknowledgement-clock) Tj T*
(start at the window end. A detection outside the window receives no such deferral. The) Tj T*
(thirty-minute P2 acknowledgement allowance then runs from that effective start, inclusive at) Tj T*
(its deadline. This is a specific adjustment to an acknowledgement clock, not a declaration) Tj T*
(that the incident did not exist until the window ended. It does not change the accepted) Tj T*
(detection record, allow a missed acknowledgement before an already-ended window to be) Tj T*
(excused, or add time to a P1 containment limit. The incident and maintenance identifiers) Tj T*
(must match the authorized operation.) Tj T*
